","subtitle":"The Werkmeister Reading Room inside historic Dodd Hall","notes":"Bring reading work and pause to examine the windows and artifacts; confirm museum hours first because events and breaks can change access.","short_summary":"A historic reading room that combines study tables with exhibits documenting the university’s past.","evidence_claim":"FSU Libraries locates the Heritage Museum in Dodd Hall’s Werkmeister Reading Room and says it displays university photographs, artifacts, and commemorative stained-glass windows.","source_url":"https://www.lib.fsu.edu/special-collections/heritage-and-university-archives/heritage-museum","source_title":"FSU Heritage Museum","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Students and the public are encouraged to visit; check the Libraries hours page because breaks or events may alter access.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"fsu-student-union","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"FSU Student Union","title":"Build a Between-Classes Base","subtitle":"Services, meeting spaces, recreation, and lounges under one roof","notes":"Check the building directory, then choose a lounge, meeting room, or recreation area that fits the time and purpose of your campus break.","short_summary":"A central multipurpose building where students can meet, handle errands, attend programs, or spend a break indoors.","evidence_claim":"The FSU Student Union says its building contains student services, meeting spaces, entertainment venues, lounges, bowling and billiards, and administrative offices.","source_url":"https://union.fsu.edu/union-spaces","source_title":"Explore the Student Union Spaces","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Individual venues and meeting rooms may have separate schedules, eligibility requirements, reservations, or charges.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"fsu-askew-student-life-center","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Askew Student Life Center","title":"Trade Screen Time for Shared Play","subtitle":"Cinema, gaming, and hands-on art at the ASLC","notes":"Look at the current program schedule, then meet friends for Student Life Cinema, the gaming lounge, or a Paint-A-Pot session.","short_summary":"A student-life venue grouping film, gaming, and creative activities in one identifiable campus destination.","evidence_claim":"The FSU Student Union identifies the Askew Student Life Center as a space for entertainment, recreation, and creativity, including Student Life Cinema, Garnet Gaming Lounge, and Paint-A-Pot.","source_url":"https://union.fsu.edu/union-spaces","source_title":"Explore the Student Union Spaces","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Check each ASLC program or venue for its current schedule, admission policy, reservation rules, and possible activity fees.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"fsu-innovation-hub","subject_type":"study_space","entity_name":"FSU Innovation Hub","title":"Turn a Group Idea Into a Prototype","subtitle":"Collaborative workspace and makerspace at 142 Collegiate Loop","notes":"Reserve a study room for planning, then ask Hub staff about the current process before using fabrication or immersive-media equipment.","short_summary":"A flexible campus workspace for studying, design collaboration, digital fabrication, and emerging-media projects.","evidence_claim":"FSU describes the Innovation Hub as an FSU-ID-accessible collaborative workspace and makerspace with study rooms, group space, a digital fabrication lab, and immersive-media resources.","source_url":"https://www.innovation.fsu.edu/hub","source_title":"About the Hub","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Open to people with an FSU ID; study rooms are reservable, and equipment may require its own reservation or operating procedure.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"fsu-the-globe","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"The Globe","title":"Find a Purpose-Built Pause","subtitle":"Student lounge, reflection room, and intercultural spaces","notes":"Use the lounge to meet, the reading room to slow down, or the meditation room for quiet reflection during its posted weekday access window.","short_summary":"A multicultural engagement building with several public student spaces designed for gathering, reading, and reflection.","evidence_claim":"FSU’s venue page says The Globe contains public student spaces including a lounge, Reflections Reading Room, café area, and a Meditation Room for the FSU community.","source_url":"https://calendar.fsu.edu/global_and_multicultural_engagement_the_globegme","source_title":"Global and Multicultural Engagement Building (GME)","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The cited page lists Meditation Room access from 8 a.m.–5 p.m.; other rooms and programs may have separate reservation rules.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"fsu-honors-scholars-fellows-house","subject_type":"study_space","entity_name":"Honors, Scholars, and Fellows House","title":"Gather, Recharge, or Compare Notes","subtitle":"Academic community space facing Landis Green","notes":"Use the house for peer study, a meeting, or a reset between commitments, while respecting any program-specific access and room rules.","short_summary":"A named academic-community building with gathering, study, meeting, and recharge spaces for participating students.","evidence_claim":"FSU’s Honors Program says the Honors, Scholars, and Fellows House contains spaces where students can study, socialize, meet with peers, or rest and recharge.","source_url":"https://honors.fsu.edu/people-and-places/honors-scholars-fellows-house-hsf","source_title":"The Honors, Scholars, Fellows House (HSF)","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The building houses Honors and other academic-support programs; verify eligibility and reservations for particular rooms or services.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"fsu-lakefront-park","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"FSU Lakefront Park & Retreat Center","title":"Take Campus Life to Lake Bradford","subtitle":"Paddling, swimming, games, and shaded gathering space","notes":"Check facility status before leaving campus, pack closed-toe shoes if climbing, and follow staff directions around swimming and equipment checkout.","short_summary":"An off-main-campus FSU recreation site where students can paddle, swim, picnic, play field games, or gather in the shade.","evidence_claim":"FSU Campus Recreation describes the 73-acre Lake Bradford facility as offering kayaking, paddleboarding, swimming, disc golf, sand volleyball, a climbing wall, and picnic areas.","source_url":"https://campusrec.fsu.edu/outdoors/lake/","source_title":"FSU Lakefront Park","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":"2026-06-29","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Four miles from main campus; check current hours and facility status. Admission, rentals, clinics, and guest access follow separate rules.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
